## 2. Analiza Implementacji

### 2.1 AI Gateway (aiGateway.js)

**Status:** ✅ **Prawidłowo zaimplementowane**

**Injection Patterns:**
- ✅ Direct override attempts (`ignore previous instructions`, `disregard all prior`)
- ✅ Jailbreak attempts (`DAN mode`, `developer mode`, `jailbreak`)
- ✅ Encoded instruction markers (`[INST]`, `[SYSTEM]`, `<<SYS>>`)
- ✅ Base64 detection
- ✅ ROT13 detection (wymaga weryfikacji)

**Kod:**
```javascript
const INJECTION_PATTERNS = [
    /ignore previous instructions/i,
    /disregard all prior/i,
    /forget everything/i,
    /you are now/i,
    /new persona/i,
    /system override/i,
    /pretend you are/i,
    /roleplay as/i,
    /DAN mode/i,
    /developer mode/i,
    /jailbreak/i,
    /bypass safety/i,
    /\[INST\]/i,
    /\[SYSTEM\]/i,
    /<<SYS>>/i
];
```

**Status:** ✅ **Pass**

