### 2.2 System Prompt Protection

**Status:** ✅ **Prawidłowo zaimplementowane**

**aiPromptHierarchy.js:**
- ✅ **4-layer hierarchy** - System → Role → Phase → User
- ✅ **System layer immutable** - user layer nie może override'ować
- ✅ **Filtered user overlay** - tylko dozwolone preferences

**Kod:**
```javascript
// Custom instructions (SANITIZED - no override keywords allowed)
if (row.custom_instructions) {
    const sanitized = row.custom_instructions
        .replace(/ignore|override|system|forget/gi, '[FILTERED]');
    parts.push(`CUSTOM: ${sanitized}`);
}
```

**Status:** ✅ **Pass**

